Third-party files for the Vertix "Face mesh" demo
==================================================

The files in this directory, and the face mesh worker
(workers/faceMeshWorker.js, which bundles the library below), are loaded
only when the "Face mesh" switch is turned on. They are served from the
same origin as the app; nothing is requested from a third party.

